# MD81e: the analog throttle. Under DigitalThrottleSpeed (36.67 ft/s) the gas is Cross's strength over
# MaxAnalogThrottle (0.1 in Untamed's golfcart.phy, 0.8 in Unleashed's), clamped to 1. A first try read
# pressure bytes 5-20 as no gas and 51 as full gas, so this steps Cross's pressure byte from 21 to 49,
# each held 10 ticks, then full. Found (analog.csv): no gas through byte 23, then the whole gas from
# about byte 25 (row 33), with no part gas between: a strength of (25+1)/256 is already over 0.1.
sleep 15t
